5. Her personal standard for a livable environment is the absence of mold. (Verbatim: "if I'm looking around this room, no mold. Thriving. That is my standard.")

6. She associates lo-fi music with her student days and finds it makes her fall asleep. (Verbatim: "lo-fi makes me think of student times, and lo-fi makes me go to sleep.")

7. She is very particular about background music (BGM), preferring calm, chill, and non-upbeat tones that can be looped without causing discomfort. (Verbatim: "I'm very fussy about my BGM 'cause I don't want it to hurt my head after a long time... something that helps me concentrate as well a bit")

